            "line": 467,
            "text": "theorem pressureMass_radialWeighted (k : ℕ) (f : PressureStream.Lift P → ℝ) (p : P) :\n    PressureStream.pressureMass (radialWeighted k f) p =\n      IntegratedMeanBalances.radialMoment k (PressureStream.torusAverage f) p"
